.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-mora-hook 1  "hook " 
.SH NAME
git\-mora\-hook \- Run a topic\-tracking adapter from an existing Git hook
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit mora hook\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a topic\-tracking adapter from an existing Git hook
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
git\-mora\-hook\-post\-commit(1)
Add the new HEAD to the effective topic context
.TP
git\-mora\-hook\-post\-rewrite(1)
Carry topic membership onto rewritten commits (reads old/new pairs on stdin)
.TP
git\-mora\-hook\-post\-merge(1)
Annotate a newly created merge commit
